('REPLY', 'Re: Candidature spontanée – Consultant Technique', 'Greetings, Thank you for reaching out to Seneca Innovation Center and for your interest in joining our team. We are currently evaluating our team''s needs based on our upcoming projects and ongoing activities. Once this process is completed, we will have a clearer view of the internship and employment opportunities available. We will get back to you as soon as we have relevant opportunities that match your profile and our current needs.', 'REJECTION', '2026-10-18 19:36:14.043937+00'),
('REPLY', 'Petit retour sur ta candidature SFEIR', 'Hello Hamza, Un grand merci pour ta candidature et pour l’intérêt que tu portes à SFEIR Luxembourg ! J''ai pris le temps d''étudier ta candidature et j''ai beaucoup apprécié ton parcours et tes projets ! Malheureusement, notre marché actuel ne correspond pas encore parfaitement à ton profil pour l''instant car il requiert un peu plus d''expérience post-étude. Ce n’est en rien un jugement sur la qualité de ta candidature, bien au contraire ! Je garde ton profil en tête (et dans notre base) pour de futures opportunités, et je serais ravie de te recontacter le moment venu.', 'REJECTION', '2026-10-18 19:36:14.043937+00'),
('REPLY', 'Conservation des données', 'Bonjour, Suite à votre candidature ou aux échanges dans le cadre d''un éventuel processus de recrutement dont vous avez fait l’objet chez SFEIR, nous nous permettons, sauf opposition de votre part, de conserver vos données personnelles dans notre base de données pendant 2 ans.', 'OTHER', '2026-10-18 19:36:14.043937+00'),
('REPLY', 'Your application at Proximus Luxembourg', 'Dear Hamza MOALLA, We thank you for showing interest in Proximus Luxembourg. We have thoroughly examined your CV for the PAT Platform Developer - C position. Unfortunately, your profile does not correspond to the needs we currently have. We regret that we cannot give a positive response to your application. Given these high numbers of applicants, we are afraid that we are not in a position to give detailed feedback to individual candidates.', 'REJECTION', '2026-10-18 19:36:14.043937+00'),
('REPLY', 'Site Reliability Engineer (Guardicore AI Platform) - Remote 3497 at Akamai Technologies', 'Hi hamza, Thank you for your interest regarding the Site Reliability Engineer (Guardicore AI Platform) - Remote (Job ID: 3497). After careful consideration, we regret to inform you that you have not been selected for this position. We will retain your information in our database and may inform you of job openings that match your profile if you selected this option.', 'REJECTION', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'FIS Application Update - Hamza Moalla - JR0308866 Product Technical Support Analyst', 'Dear Hamza, Thank you for your time and interest in FIS. Unfortunately, given the timing of your application, your resume wasn''t reviewed prior to the hiring decision being made. We''re sorry that we missed you! While you are not being considered further for this position, you may qualify for a number of our other posted positions.', 'REJECTION', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'Response to your job application for Junior Business Analyst at Quanthouse', 'Dear Hamza Moalla, Thank you for your interest in QuantHouse Tunisia and for taking the time to apply for BA Junior position. After careful consideration, we regret to inform you that we have decided to move forward with other candidates whose profiles more closely match our current requirements for this role.', 'REJECTION', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'Your application for DevOps Engineer (m/w/d) - Cloud & Platform Engineering at My Project Box', 'Hello Hamza, Thank you for taking the time to apply for the DevOps Engineer (m/w/d) - Cloud & Platform Engineering position at My Project Box. After careful consideration, we regret to inform you that we will not be moving forward with your application at this time.', 'REJECTION', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'Re:Your application at Alpitronic - DevOps Engineer (m/f/d) - hamza moalla', 'Dear hamza, thank you for your interest in Alpitronic. We regret to inform you that you were not shortlisted for the open position of DevOps Engineer (m/f/d). The selection process is highly competitive, and we have decided to move forward with candidates whose qualifications better meet our needs at this time.', 'REJECTION', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'Your Job Application | much. Consulting', 'Dear Hamza Moalla, Thank you again for applying for the Software Engineer PT position at much. Unfortunately, we have to let you know that we will not proceed with your application. We wish you all the best in your job search and hope we will have the chance to consider you for another role in the future.', 'REJECTION', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'hamza moalla and SingleStore', 'Hi hamza, Thank you for your interest in the Site Reliability Engineer role at SingleStore, and for the time you invested in getting to know us. After reviewing your experience, we''ve decided not to move forward with your application for this role.', 'REJECTION', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'Thank you', 'Dear hamza, Thank you for your interest in the Infrastructure Engineer II (Fixed-Term 24 months) position at LNDS. We are very sorry to inform you that other candidate profiles were deemed to be a better match for the criteria that have been defined for this position. Therefore, your application has not been selected for additional consideration at this time.', 'REJECTION', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'Thank you for interest in Ingénieur Développement -6012999408112026', 'Hi Hamza, Thank you for taking the time to apply for this role with ADP. We appreciate the time you''ve invested in this process. While we were impressed with your experience, we have decided to move forward with other candidates.', 'REJECTION', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'Distribusion Technologies - Confirmation of your application', 'Dear Hamza, Thanks for your interest in Distribusion Technologies! Important Action Required: As you have applied via a different platform (Wellfound, Email, direct outreach, others), we need you to give us your GDPR consent in order to process your application in our Talent pool.', 'OTHER', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'Thank you for applying to Redwood Materials', 'Hi hamza, Thank you for your interest in Redwood Materials! Your email has been received and we''re excited that you would consider joining our team. We will review your information as soon as we can and we''ll be in touch if your qualifications align with our needs.', 'IN_REVIEW', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', '¡Gracias por tu interés en REVEL! 🚀', '¡Hola, hamza! ¡Muchísimas gracias por tu interés en sumarte a REVEL! Te confirmamos que hemos recibido tu candidatura correctamente. En los próximos días, nuestro equipo de People revisará con detalle tu perfil.', 'IN_REVIEW', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'Thank you for your application to My Project Box', 'Hello Hamza, Thank you for applying to the DevOps Engineer (m/w/d) - Cloud & Platform Engineering position at My Project Box. We appreciate your interest in joining our team. Our hiring team is reviewing your application and will be in touch soon.', 'IN_REVIEW', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'Thank you for applying to SingleStore!', 'Hi hamza, Thanks for applying to SingleStore. Your application is in, and our team will be taking a closer look. If your experience lines up with what we''re looking for, someone from our Talent team will be in touch.', 'IN_REVIEW', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'We received your application for a position at much. GmbH', 'Hi Hamza, You have successfully submitted your application for this position: Junior Python Software Engineer (m/f/d). Someone will review your qualifications shortly.', 'IN_REVIEW', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'Prise de compte de votre candidature', 'Bonjour hamza, Nous avons bien reçu votre candidature et nous vous remercions de l''intérêt que vous portez à ADDINN Group. Nous allons étudier votre dossier avec la plus grande attention.', 'IN_REVIEW', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'Thank you for your application at Alpitronic', 'Dear hamza, thank you for your interest in the open position DevOps Engineer (m/f/d) at Alpitronic and for taking the initiative to apply. We have received your application and will process it as soon as possible.', 'IN_REVIEW', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'Tanitjobs.com: Alerte Emploi', 'Bonjour, Voici les dernières offres d''emploi publiées sur Tanitjobs.com qui pourraient vous intéresser: Commercial back office, Agent Commercial Comptoir, Assistant(e).', 'OTHER', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'Hamza, 15 offres récentes proches de votre recherche', 'Hello Hamza ! 15 nouvelles offres s''approchent de vos recherches. Alternance - Technicien Cloud - BTS S.I.O H/F, Product Manager Cloud.', 'OTHER', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'Dernières opportunités sur Free-Work !', 'Dernières offres d''emploi: CDI - AI Engineer, CDI - Business Analyst, CDI - Responsable ERP. Découvrez les offres qui correspondent le mieux avec votre profil.', 'OTHER', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', '[GitHub] Please verify your device', 'Hey hamzamoalla! A sign in attempt requires further verification because we did not recognize your device. Verification code: 289537.', 'OTHER', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'Here''s your verification code from ADP', 'Verification code 051893. This code expires in 15 minutes. Enter this code to access ADP services.', 'OTHER', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'Demande de renouvellement de la conservation de vos données personnelles', 'Bonjour, Afin de garantir une meilleure gestion des candidatures, Safran a mis à jour sa plateforme de recrutement et a uniformisé sa politique de protection des données personnelles.', 'OTHER', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'The skills that pay more, at half the price.', 'Skill tracks that change what you''re worth, now at 50% off a month. AI skills now command a 23% higher advertised salary.', 'OTHER', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'Get more out of OpenAI, in 3 free live sessions', 'Oct 13-15. One registration unlocks everything. You''ve asked ChatGPT plenty of questions. Next week we show you how to hand it a job instead.', 'OTHER', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'Ask Grok what''s happening now', 'It checks the web and X before it answers. Grok searches the web and X before it answers. Start with a topic, a draft, or a screenshot.', 'OTHER', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', 'Prêt pour AWS Cloud Solutions Architect ?', 'Limited time! 3 months of Google AI Pro at no extra cost. Découvrez plus de 10 000 cours pendant 7 jours. AWS Cloud Solutions Architect.', 'OTHER', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00'),
('REPLY', '3 new courses: Azure AI-901, Amazon Bedrock and Grafana Loki', 'Hi Hamza, We''ve added three new courses in the last fortnight, covering Microsoft''s new AI-901 exam, building generative AI apps on Amazon Bedrock, and Grafana Loki.', 'OTHER', '2026-10-18 19:47:28.099149+00');
